{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026iCradLJktp1795650102.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>安永預計，明年港股新股集資額有望達到3,000億元，繼續穩守全球前三。</p><p></p><p>安永香港資本市場服務發言人賴耘峯表示：「港交所今年穩站第二位，我們預計在年底不會有重大改變，而集資額也創了5年新高。隨著交易所現時正進行不同諮詢，進行競爭力方面的優化，再加上600多間公司排隊上市，我們預計它能夠穩守三甲機會比較高。」</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-26T00:17:22.624885+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":153,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-25T23:40:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-26T05:34:46.086538+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-26T00:10:48.407264+00:00","content_hash":"2a41c5b3ae2873b239bbe872b1dbae99c0d4a58ae0ff1181b39cd0e56b6e6b08","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}